# Open UI ↔ V2 API contract

When implementing or changing anything in this package that talks to `/admin/api/v2/` (hooks in `src/api/`, client, types, pages, components):

1. Read the matching committed contract under `api-specs/`. Search for the endpoint path, tag, or `#/definitions/...`:
   - `api-specs/ui-api.yaml` — UI-shaped endpoints
   - `api-specs/data-api.yaml` — entity CRUD
   - `api-specs/stats-api.yaml` — reports and analytics
   - `api-specs/system-api.yaml` — system endpoints

2. Do not invent query params, paths, or response shapes; match the documented contract.

3. Regenerate types after a committed contract change with `pnpm run generate-types`.
